> normalized ToolInvocation -> ToolResult contract.
> 
> Usage:
>     broker = OpenAIProgrammaticBroker(
>         client=openai_client,
>         model="gpt-6-astra",
>         callable_tools={"get_inventory": inventory_spec},
>         artifact_factory=make_artifact,
>         result_factory=make_tool_result,
>     )
> 
>     tool = broker.as_tool()
>     result = tool.fn(ToolInvocation(
>         operation_id="...",
>         conversation_id="...",
>         arguments={"input": "Compare inventory with demand for sku_123."},
>         config={},
>         context=None,
>         provenance_requirements={},
>     ))
> 
> Tool-produced content remains untrusted external data. This broker stores model
> and program output in artifacts; callers must not inject it into system prompts.
> """
> 
